      "id": 1,
      "text": "In 2001 the Dover Plains Library moved to larger quarters, and the town now uses the donated Tabor‑Wing House for offices and a local history room.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
